WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.006 --> 00:00:21.596
It was the day of the royal race.

2
00:00:21.597 --> 00:00:32.732
All the carriages were ready at the starting line.

3
00:00:32.733 --> 00:00:35.687
One carriage was made of feathers.

4
00:00:35.688 --> 00:00:37.506
It was very light.

5
00:00:37.507 --> 00:00:40.727
It floated above the ground.

6
00:00:40.728 --> 00:00:44.129
Another carriage was pulled by unicorns.

7
00:00:44.130 --> 00:00:47.497
The unicorns looked very fast.

8
00:00:47.498 --> 00:00:51.584
Walter stood near a carriage that sparkled with magic.

9
00:00:51.585 --> 00:00:55.806
It was pulled by seven white swans.

10
00:00:55.807 --> 00:00:58.248
Tom gulped.

11
00:00:58.249 --> 00:01:01.802
"What if my king doesn't win?" he said.

12
00:01:01.803 --> 00:01:04.848
"I will go to the Grim Dungeon.

13
00:01:04.849 --> 00:01:08.287
Walter will laugh and laugh."

14
00:01:08.288 --> 00:01:11.864
"You have a good heart," said Cat.

15
00:01:11.865 --> 00:01:15.806
"Everything will work out fine. You'll see."

16
00:01:15.807 --> 00:01:19.795
Walter looked at the wings on the king’s carriage.

17
00:01:19.796 --> 00:01:22.585
"Ha-ha!" he said.

18
00:01:22.586 --> 00:01:25.023
"Your spell won't work, Tom.

19
00:01:25.024 --> 00:01:28.005
Your king will lose for sure."

20
00:01:28.006 --> 00:01:31.248
Walter's swans hissed at Tom.

21
00:01:31.249 --> 00:01:34.689
When they saw Cat, they flapped their wings.

22
00:01:34.690 --> 00:01:37.330
They tried to chase her.

23
00:01:37.331 --> 00:01:40.654
Cat hid in Tom's pocket.

24
00:01:40.655 --> 00:01:43.746
"Those swans are mean!" Tom said.

25
00:01:43.747 --> 00:01:57.384
"Just like Walter!"

26
00:01:57.385 --> 00:02:05.917
Finally the kings climbed onto their carriages.

27
00:02:05.918 --> 00:02:11.028
The wizards got on too.

28
00:02:11.029 --> 00:02:13.815
Cat jumped out of Tom's pocket.

29
00:02:13.816 --> 00:02:25.541
"Good luck. I'll wait at the finish line to see who wins!"

30
00:02:25.542 --> 00:02:34.322
A trumpet blared.

31
00:02:34.323 --> 00:02:43.888
And the royal race began!
